# Ignore rules for the Dataflow Flex Template image ONLY (Dockerfile.dataflow).
# The root .dockerignore serves the Java target-system-mock build and excludes
# pipelines/ and contracts/ — exactly what this image needs. Both podman/buildah
# and Docker BuildKit prefer <Dockerfile>.dockerignore over the root file.

